~ start
if QuestManager.talked_to_npcs.get("NPCGreen", false) == true:
	NPCGreen: Good luck.
	=> END
npcgreen: You're not from here.
npcgreen: Who are you?
astryn: Astryn, I'm looking for a magic shop, one that sells healing items.
npcgreen: *Chuckles* You can try the place in that alley there; ain't gonna like them prices though.
if QuestManager.talked_to_team["Novius"] == true or QuestManager.talked_to_team["Aegrandir"] == true:
	Astryn: Yeah, I've heard. Thank you.
	NPCGreen: Them bastards won't let us have shit.
else:
	Astryn: Why so?
	NPCGreen: Them greedy, rich-ass bastards won't let us have shit.
	Astryn: Who?
	NPCGreen: The military; they run this town.
npcgreen: Leader's name is Vorkoth.
npcgreen: All we can afford is food, and we can't afford to get out of this place either.
astryn: Don't worry, that'll change soon.
npcgreen: Don't tell me you outsiders… Well, good luck to you folk.
npcgreen: People here are so beat down they can't fight back, so thank you.
astryn: Our pleasure.
do QuestManager.mark_npc_talked_to("NPCGreen")
=> END
